# Task: Define Bus trait + subscription model

## What
```rust
// governed-by: ADR-0003
trait Bus {
  async fn publish(&self, event: Event) -> Result<PublishOk>;
  async fn subscribe(&self, filter: Filter) -> Result<Subscription>;
  // plus health/liveness for health_check tool
}
```
- Filters mirror NIP-01: authors, kinds, since, until, limit, #e, #p, #t, #l
- Subscription yields stream of events + EOSE-equivalent for historical catch-up on InProcessBus

## Why
Mailbox core and projection depend only on trait — swap InProcess vs Relay without tool changes.

## Tests
Mock/in-memory double for unit tests of mailbox later.

# Task: Backend trait definition

## What
```rust
// governed-by: ADR-0003
#[async_trait]
trait Backend {
  async fn spawn(...) -> Result<PaneId>;
  async fn prompt(...) -> Result<()>;
  async fn wait(...) -> Result<AgentStatus>;
  async fn read(...) -> Result<String>;
  async fn send_keys(...) -> Result<()>;
  async fn events(...) -> Result<EventStream>;
}
```
Plus error types with machine codes.

## Tests
- Trait object compilable; mock backend for mailbox tests if needed
